sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant S as Scan screen<br/>Type it in pop-up
  participant T as TypedEntry.Understand
  participant P as IngredientTextParser
  participant I as ProductIndex (phone)
  participant G as Gemini API
  U->>S: types a list or a product name
  S->>T: Understand(text)
  alt ingredients
    T->>P: Read(text): split, stoplist, close names
    P-->>S: known + unrecognised names
  else product name
    S->>I: InventoryProductFor(name, brand)
    alt in catalogue
      I-->>S: product + stored list
    else not found, online
      S->>G: FindTyped (one of 2 look-ups per visit)
      G-->>S: brand, name, sourced list, or notMakeup / question
    end
  end
  S-->>U: analysis through LoadingScene, or a message
